  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39062550",
      "title": "Uploading Files & Restrictions Workaround",
      "sourceHash": "860b3ffb10f604ac51ad4b0739c45be68149db526b40c877dceac1c80951124a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 6.06,
          "en": "Now for certain tasks you might want ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.06,
          "end": 7.95,
          "en": "to execute for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.95,
          "end": 12.72,
          "en": "you also might need to share data with ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.72,
          "end": 16.35,
          "en": "For example, here I have an AI text file locally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.35,
          "end": 20.28,
          "en": "on my system, which is simply a file that contains some text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.28,
          "end": 22.11,
          "en": "about artificial intelligence",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.11,
          "end": 25.29,
          "en": "and how it evolved over the last years.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.29,
          "end": 28.14,
          "en": "Now for some reason this entire text is written",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.14,
          "end": 33.14,
          "en": "in all lowercase characters and I might want to use ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.21,
          "end": 38.21,
          "en": "and Code Interpreter to properly capitalize this text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.31,
          "end": 41.31,
          "en": "So that for example, the first word",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.31,
          "end": 45.54,
          "en": "of every sentence starts with a capital character.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.54,
          "end": 50.49,
          "en": "So therefore here I need to share this file with ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 50.49,
          "end": 51.93,
          "en": "Now of course you did learn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.93,
          "end": 54.45,
          "en": "that ChatGPT does not have access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.45,
          "end": 56.31,
          "en": "to your hard drive though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.31,
          "end": 60.75,
          "en": "but thankfully, you can upload files to ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.75,
          "end": 63,
          "en": "when using Code Interpreter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63,
          "end": 65.28,
          "en": "because when using Code Interpreter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.28,
          "end": 68.28,
          "en": "and only then not in the other modes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.28,
          "end": 71.49,
          "en": "But when using that you have this plus button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.49,
          "end": 74.19,
          "en": "which allows you to upload a file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.19,
          "end": 75.48,
          "en": "and you can therefore then of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.48,
          "end": 80.22,
          "en": "use this button to select and upload a file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.22,
          "end": 82.17,
          "en": "And there is a limit regarding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.17,
          "end": 85.71000000000001,
          "en": "the maximum file size you can upload here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.71000000000001,
          "end": 88.68,
          "en": "At the moment it's 100 megabytes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.68,
          "end": 91.41,
          "en": "And whenever you do upload a file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.41,
          "end": 93.66,
          "en": "which you now also could delete",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.66,
          "end": 97.97999999999999,
          "en": "and re-upload if you accidentally uploaded the wrong file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.97999999999999,
          "end": 100.28999999999999,
          "en": "But whenever you did upload a file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.28999999999999,
          "end": 104.4,
          "en": "this file will automatically be taken into account",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.4,
          "end": 109.08,
          "en": "by ChatGPT when it uses Code Interpreter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.08,
          "end": 111.27000000000001,
          "en": "So this file is made available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.27000000000001,
          "end": 113.82,
          "en": "in that isolated execution environment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.82,
          "end": 116.19,
          "en": "provided by OpenAI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.19,
          "end": 118.32,
          "en": "And therefore here we could then, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.32,
          "end": 122.43,
          "en": "tell ChatGPT to convert the text in the uploaded file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.43,
          "end": 125.37,
          "en": "to properly capitalized text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.37,
          "end": 128.16,
          "en": "And when we do that, again ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.16,
          "end": 131.52,
          "en": "will use Code Interpreter to generate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.52,
          "end": 133.89,
          "en": "and then also execute some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.89,
          "end": 136.77,
          "en": "that does indeed use this file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.77,
          "end": 139.53,
          "en": "to capitalize the text in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.53,
          "end": 142.11,
          "en": "In this case here, it actually generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.11,
          "end": 146.22,
          "en": "two separate pieces of code and it did indeed try to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.22,
          "end": 150.42000000000002,
          "en": "a library in that code that was generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.42000000000002,
          "end": 154.383,
          "en": "that is not supported in this environment here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.22,
          "end": 159.09,
          "en": "And as I mentioned before, fortunately a ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.09,
          "end": 163.47,
          "en": "is then often able to detect the problem and fall back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.47,
          "end": 168,
          "en": "to an alternative solution like it did here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168,
          "end": 172.32,
          "en": "where it then generated an executed some alternative code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.32,
          "end": 175.26,
          "en": "that also solves the problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 175.26,
          "end": 178.53,
          "en": "Now that solution might not be as good",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.53,
          "end": 181.05,
          "en": "as the first solution its tried.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 181.05,
          "end": 184.65,
          "en": "For example, here when it comes to capitalizing the text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.65,
          "end": 187.59,
          "en": "it's now using a simpler approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.59,
          "end": 191.31,
          "en": "which might not handle all Edge cases,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 191.31,
          "end": 193.65,
          "en": "but it will produce a result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.65,
          "end": 197.37,
          "en": "And often that result will be absolutely fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 197.37,
          "end": 200.16,
          "en": "As it is here, where I am indeed getting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 200.16,
          "end": 203.28,
          "en": "my properly capitalized text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 203.28,
          "end": 208.28,
          "en": "Now, as you can see here, ChatGPT also actually detects that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 208.5,
          "end": 213.36,
          "en": "because it had to use this simpler alternative approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 213.36,
          "end": 217.35,
          "en": "certain special words to be precise acronyms",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 217.35,
          "end": 219,
          "en": "that might be stored in this text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219,
          "end": 222.72,
          "en": "like NLP were not capitalized.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.72,
          "end": 223.86,
          "en": "But it even asks me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 223.86,
          "end": 226.47,
          "en": "if it should enhance its solution to do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 226.47,
          "end": 229.71,
          "en": "And since we're sharing one single environment here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 229.71,
          "end": 232.62,
          "en": "across multiple messages as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 232.62,
          "end": 235.71,
          "en": "I can simply say yes, please",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 235.71,
          "end": 240.71,
          "en": "also capitalize acronyms and nouns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 243.21,
          "end": 246.87,
          "en": "And with that ChatGPT will again produce",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 246.87,
          "end": 251.34,
          "en": "some new code that takes the result from before into account",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 251.34,
          "end": 254.733,
          "en": "and that does not aim to produce a better result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 258.9,
          "end": 262.14,
          "en": "Here you see that it simply also now looks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 262.14,
          "end": 267.14,
          "en": "for AI, NLP and gans in our text, and that it will then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 267.69,
          "end": 271.77,
          "en": "manually transform all these words to uppercase variance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 271.77,
          "end": 274.053,
          "en": "of those words in the final text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 275.52,
          "end": 279.933,
          "en": "And with that NLP, for example, is properly capitalized.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
